  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-28T05:18:22.511Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "To give the ability to give as much power as possible to have as HIGH QUALITY audio for the best experience in the game. Better sounding instrument playing, talking to others... the voices... better feeling and emotion from being able to hear as much audio as possible from the game which you can immerse yourself in. Good addition with the new interactive settings. Good match together.",
